      "title_cn": "Cloudflare 2026 生日周发布汇总",
      "title_en": "Everything we launched during Birthday Week 2026",
      "title_original": "Everything we launched during Birthday Week 2026",
      "source": "Cloudflare Blog",
      "published_at": "2026-10-05T13:00:00+00:00",
      "original_url": "https://blog.cloudflare.com/birthday-week-2026-wrap-up/",
      "category": "internet",
      "original_language": "en",
      "what_happened": "Cloudflare 在 2026 生日周庆祝成立 16 周年，并发布开源、应用安全、后量子过渡、代理互联网新经济模式以及开发者平台的数据分析、存储、AI 和代理开发工具。公司表示自动化流量首次超过人类活动。",
      "what_happened_en": "Cloudflare marked its 16th birthday with Birthday Week 2026, announcing work across open source, application security, the post-quantum transition, new economic models for the agentic Internet, and Developer Platform tools for data analysis, storage, AI, and agent development. The company said automated traffic surpassed human activity for the first time.",
      "why_it_matters": "自动化流量和代理驱动推荐的转变正在改变互联网的扩展方式以及新企业成功的机会。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "The shift toward automated traffic and agent-driven recommendations changes how the Internet scales and how new businesses can succeed.",
