      "title_cn": "从扫描到治疗方案，AI 帮助弥合乳腺癌最致命的差距",
      "title_en": "From Scan to Treatment Plan, AI Helps Close Breast Cancer’s Deadliest Gaps",
      "title_original": "From Scan to Treatment Plan, AI Helps Close Breast Cancer’s Deadliest Gaps",
      "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
      "published_at": "2026-10-05T13:00:57+00:00",
      "original_url": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/ai-breast-cancer-startups/",
      "category": "chips",
      "original_language": "en",
      "what_happened": "NVIDIA Inception 计划中的公司正在构建 AI 应用，以支持临床医生进行乳腺癌成像、风险评估和治疗规划。美国每年约进行 4000 万次乳腺 X 光检查，而预计未来十年将短缺数万名放射科医生，使系统容量承压。",
      "what_happened_en": "Companies in the NVIDIA Inception program are building AI applications to support clinicians in breast cancer imaging, risk assessment, and treatment planning. About 40 million mammograms are performed in the U.S. each year, and a projected shortfall of tens of thousands of radiologists over the next decade is straining capacity.",
      "why_it_matters": "AI 应用旨在解决乳腺癌护理中放射科医生短缺和基因组检测数周延迟的问题。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "AI applications aim to address radiologist shortages and weeks-long genomic assay delays in breast cancer care.",
